{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_knowledge_cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20", "label": "CME Seller-Flow Replication Study", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_knowledge_cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20_seller_flow_boost", "label": "Seller-Flow Boost", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "wick_trap 1.25x sizing on taker_imbalance <= 0 flushes (buy flushes driven by seller aggression/capitulation, not buyer aggression). The thesis replicates directionally on independent CME institutional flow (flush + seller aggression +0.41% fwd 168h vs -1.73% buyer-aggressed) - market structure, not a venue artifact.", "source_file": "cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_knowledge_cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20_taker_snapshot_bug", "label": "Live taker_imbalance Snapshot Bug", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Live taker_imbalance was a once-per-hour OKX point snapshot ((ratio-1)/max(ratio,0.01)) - white noise (r=0.017 vs CME hourly aggressor flow, autocorr 0.007) - while the VALIDATED store feature is Binance Vision's true 1h aggregate. The live boost condition therefore fired on ~random noise; fix = aggregate taker volume over the full hour to match the store definition.", "source_file": "cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_knowledge_cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20", "target": "docs_knowledge_cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20_seller_flow_boost", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "cme_seller_flow_replication_2026_08_20.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source"